"给下一张已启用卡片。"
msgstr ""
"Drag a card by its title bar to change the order. Run the workflow again "
"after reordering because each top-level card passes its output to the next "
"enabled card."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:27
