msgid "用左上角 `Load` 导入 `Si2.vasp`。"
msgstr "Use `Load` in the upper-left corner to import `Si2.vasp`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:30
#: 66db5592cad742f6afa1bc2049dd2331
msgid ""
"用 `Add new card` 或 `Find card` 依次添加 `Super Cell`、`Card Group`、"
"`Random Doping`、`Vacancy Defect`、`Atomic Perturb` 和 `Geometry Filter`。新"
"卡片先出现在顶层。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Add new card` or `Find card` to add `Super Cell`, `Card Group`, `Random "
"Doping`, `Vacancy Defect`, `Atomic Perturb`, and `Geometry Filter` in that "
"order. New cards first appear at the top level."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:31
#: a1fa292345044a16afb709baab75803e
msgid ""
"按住 `Random Doping` 的标题栏，把它拖进 `Card Group` 的空白区域；再用同样方法"
"拖入 `Vacancy Defect`。拖错时，把子卡片拖回工作区空白处即可回到顶层。"
msgstr ""
"Drag `Random Doping` by its title bar into the empty area of `Card Group`, "
"then do the same with `Vacancy Defect`. If a card is grouped by mistake, "
"drag it back to an empty area of the workspace to return it to the top level."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:32
#: 94b28dadadba4ce3b8db805d145c90ba
msgid "拖动标题栏，把剩余顶层卡片排成下面的顺序，再填写参数。"
msgstr ""
"Drag the title bars to arrange the remaining top-level cards as shown below, "
"then enter the parameters."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:34
#: 938bf5f3d8f44d09a5cf2f84854b1a9c
msgid ""
"Super Cell\n"
"→ Card Group [Random Doping | Vacancy Defect]\n"
"→ Atomic Perturb\n"
"→ Geometry Filter\n"
msgstr ""
"Super Cell\n"
"→ Card Group [Random Doping | Vacancy Defect]\n"
"→ Atomic Perturb\n"
"→ Geometry Filter\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 0830c1f5e4994905abe0d0323ad409ea
msgid "包含线性步骤和并行分支的完整卡片流程"
msgstr "A complete card workflow with sequential steps and parallel branches"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 0830c1f5e4994905abe0d0323ad409ea
msgid ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/card_system_workflow.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/card_system_workflow.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:46
#: 773c5256f4764ba7a16f9385a37d4c3e
msgid ""
"顶部按钮控制整条流程：`Copy JSON` 复制当前全部卡片，`Paste JSON` 把剪贴板中的"
"配置追加到现有流程，`Run` 运行所有已启用卡片，`Stop` 中止正在运行的卡片。标题"
"栏里的 `Copy JSON` 只复制单张卡片，两者不要混用。"
msgstr ""
"The top controls operate on the whole workflow: `Copy JSON` copies all "
"current cards, `Paste JSON` appends clipboard configuration to the existing "
"workflow, `Run` executes all enabled cards, and `Stop` aborts the running "
"cards. `Copy JSON` in a card title bar copies only that card, so do not "
"confuse the two."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:48
#: 2ec547ab944e4999bf230cc0ed63324e
