msgstr "`Random Doping`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 4aca5d4f8798483d8647781899a84e45
msgid "目标 `Si`；掺杂元素直接填 `Ge`；固定替换 1 个；生成 2 个；seed `42`"
msgstr ""
"Target `Si`; enter `Ge` directly as the dopant; replace exactly 1 atom; "
"generate 2 structures; seed `42`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 21cfdadc817948a999c7e1b38dbf4726
msgid "2 个 `Si15Ge`"
msgstr "Two `Si15Ge` structures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: fe4190f18b1d4777bd2059933429c9e1
msgid "`Vacancy Defect`"
msgstr "`Vacancy Defect`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 7acfbcdf897d4ebfbba6dd688f072a8f
msgid "固定移除 1 个原子；生成 2 个；seed `42`"
msgstr "Remove exactly 1 atom; generate 2 structures; seed `42`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: d5595c56cd9647c3bf817bd55d07d883
msgid "2 个 15 原子 Si 空位结构"
msgstr "Two 15-atom Si vacancy structures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 68514037f49b4a6f86e39184119ded2f
msgid "`Atomic Perturb`"
msgstr "`Atomic Perturb`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 13da3f741a1e47daa4883a3180c915d9
msgid "最大位移 `0.05 Å`；每个输入生成 2 个；seed `42`"
msgstr ""
"Maximum displacement `0.05 Å`; generate 2 structures per input; seed `42`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 9ae88a20c7684be198de0e27e8e125bc
msgid "$4\\times2=8$ 个扰动结构"
msgstr "$4\\times2=8$ perturbed structures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 1d9ccbaf57404ee2a7bb2ec708e7f469
msgid "`Geometry Filter`"
msgstr "`Geometry Filter`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: f9bd7a8f6ef34c009beb0d483d3ed105
msgid "最短距离 `1.5 Å`；要求有限晶胞"
msgstr "Minimum distance `1.5 Å`; require a finite cell"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: d3b5010ab18e4f359aa8c04b4f8c0e2f
msgid "筛掉明显碰撞或无效晶胞"
msgstr "Remove obvious collisions and invalid cells"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:58
#: bc8dc4eb91a74e7a8e1c06452da0e8b2
msgid ""
"掺杂元素输入框不是 JSON。单一元素直接写 `Ge`；多元素比例写 `Ge:0.7,C:0.3`。界"
"面恢复已保存参数时也会保持这种写法，便于直接照着修改。"
msgstr ""
"The dopant field does not use JSON. Enter `Ge` for one element or "
"`Ge:0.7,C:0.3` for a multi-element ratio. Restored settings keep this "
"editable notation so you can copy and adjust it directly."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:60
#: e42cfdeb557e4786a9efb64b77391dca
msgid "线性链和 Card Group 不要混淆"
msgstr "Do Not Confuse a Sequential Chain with Card Group"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:62
#: 54a8356864034a6e9bf85125989a42c0
msgid ""
"顶层卡片是**串行**的：`Super Cell` 的输出进入 `Card Group`，分支汇总结果再进"
"入 `Atomic Perturb`，最后交给 `Geometry Filter`。所以扩胞应放在缺陷生成前，筛"
"选应放在随机生成后。"
msgstr ""
"Top-level cards run **sequentially**: the `Super Cell` output enters `Card "
"Group`, the merged branch results enter `Atomic Perturb`, and the result "
"finally goes to `Geometry Filter`. This is why supercell generation belongs "
"before defect generation and filtering belongs after random generation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:64
#: fa18df25f1f648eba05908518367d331
msgid ""
"`Card Group` 内部是**并行分支**。本例的掺杂卡和空位卡都收到同一个 16 原子 Si "
"超胞，它们不会前后相接："
msgstr ""
"Cards inside `Card Group` are **parallel branches**. In this example, both "
"Random Doping and Vacancy Defect receive the same 16-atom Si supercell; one "
"does not feed into the other:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:66
#: dc2712d6aeae4f7f932a4127457f16da
msgid ""
"                 ┌→ Random Doping ─┐\n"
"Si16 → Card Group│                  ├→ 汇总为 4 个结构\n"
"                 └→ Vacancy Defect ┘\n"
msgstr ""
"                 ┌→ Random Doping ─┐\n"
"Si16 → Card Group│                  ├→ merge into 4 structures\n"
"                 └→ Vacancy Defect ┘\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:72
#: a57eba7681274b189411ce396576c94a
msgid ""
"只有“同一个输入要走几条不同路线”时才使用 `Card Group`。如果你想先掺杂、再从掺"
"杂结构中造空位，就应把两张卡放在顶层，按 `Random Doping → Vacancy Defect` 排"
"列，而不是放进同一个组。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Card Group` only when the same input should follow several independent "
"routes. If you want to dope first and then create vacancies in the doped "
"structures, place both cards at the top level in the order `Random Doping → "
"Vacancy Defect` instead of putting them in one group."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:74
#: 1ed7f9484638419f9c21502e41871af9
msgid "运行后沿着数量检查"
msgstr "Check the Counts after Running"

