"1 Si2 structure\n"
"→ 1 Si16 structure\n"
"→ 2 Si15Ge + 2 Si15 structures, giving 4 branch results\n"
"→ 8 perturbed structures\n"
"→ 8 structures retained by the geometry filter\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:93
#: ef19468b64cc4827938af009a3868d78
msgid ""
"每张卡底部都显示 `Input → Output / Time`。数量从哪一步开始不符合预期，就先检"
"查那一步，不要只看最终文件。如果某张卡输出为空，流程会停在这里，下游卡片不会"
"继续运行。"
msgstr ""
"Each card shows `Input → Output / Time` at the bottom. If a count first "
"becomes unexpected at a particular step, inspect that step instead of "
"checking only the final file. If a card produces no output, the workflow "
"stops there and downstream cards do not run."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:95
#: 06ee4f13323741a293c5a6db7e4fb5f7
msgid "运行完成后有三种查看或导出范围："
msgstr "After the run, there are three viewing or export scopes:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:97
#: d9cc0998b25d47f3b731f4499b552d82
msgid "卡片标题栏的查看、导出按钮：只处理这一张卡片的输出。"
msgstr ""
"The view and export buttons in a card title bar operate only on that card's "
"output."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:98
#: 489ac90d4844477c96024ca2754c7a6e
msgid ""
"顶部 `View selected outputs`：合并查看所有已勾选且已经产生结果的卡片，包含中"
"间步骤。"
msgstr ""
"`View selected outputs` at the top merges the outputs of all checked cards "
"that have results, including intermediate steps."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:99
#: e09e08962191420eb94b3b722d0eb5cc
msgid ""
"顶部 `Save` 菜单中的 `Export final workflow output`：只保存最后完成的已启用卡"
"片输出；`Export all available card outputs` 用于保留全部中间结果。"
msgstr ""
"`Export final workflow output` in the top `Save` menu saves only the output "
"of the last completed enabled card. Use `Export all available card outputs` "
"to keep all intermediate results."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:101
#: 57ea13f701374058a78b04039fdcd23c
msgid "保存的是结构，还是流程"
msgstr "Are You Saving Structures or the Workflow?"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:103
#: 85d1e11c97dc412e9b7d734a883bf84c
msgid "这两个概念必须分开："
msgstr "Keep these two concepts separate:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:105
#: 14e9321f22ac4574a00e37ec96ae19d4
msgid ""
"`Copy JSON` 或 `Save → Export Card Config` 保存卡片顺序、参数和启停状态，**不"
"包含生成结构**。"
msgstr ""
"`Copy JSON` or `Save → Export Card Config` saves card order, parameters, and "
"enabled states. It **does not contain generated structures**."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:106
#: 31502e2af27e49bcb5d6eaa04fd2f588
msgid ""
"`Paste JSON` 会把剪贴板中的单张卡片、卡片列表或完整流程追加到当前工作区，不会"
"自动清空原卡片。"
msgstr ""
"`Paste JSON` appends a single card, a card list, or a complete workflow from "
"the clipboard to the current workspace. It does not clear existing cards."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:107
#: 67f14e6ced6c4c75be34a76c5766c598
msgid "`Load → Import Card Config` 用于从 JSON 文件恢复流程。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Load → Import Card Config` to restore a workflow from a JSON file."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:108
#: a8dbbfa54c6741deabff83214913da5b
msgid "导出卡片输出或最终流程输出，保存的才是结构数据。"
msgstr ""
"Exporting a card output or the final workflow output is what saves structure "
"data."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/card-system-workflow.md:110
#: 7e07c24eb3b94210bc69578f0cd41099
msgid ""
"第一次把流程调通后，建议保存一份流程 JSON。更换输入结构时先检查元素、原子数和"
"晶胞是否仍满足这些参数，再运行；不要把同一份流程配置当作所有材料都适用的物理"
"方案。"
msgstr ""
"After the workflow works as intended, save a copy of its JSON. When changing "
"the input structures, check that their elements, atom counts, and cells "
"still fit these parameters before running. A reusable workflow configuration "
"is not a physically valid recipe for every material."

